# onnxruntime-node arrives as a dev-only transitive dependency of
# @huggingface/transformers. Its install script tries to download CUDA
# binaries from a GitHub release asset that no longer exists, so `npm ci`
# fails with "Failed to download the binaries: 404 Not Found" on any machine
# that has no CUDA toolchain -- including Vercel's builder and anyone who
# clones this repository and follows the README.
#
# Nothing here uses the CUDA execution provider. Skipping that download is
# what the installer's own error message recommends.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
